-# bootloader owns 0..96K (sector 0 code, sectors 1-2 are the param storage)
+# bootloader owns 0..96K (sector 0 code, sectors 1-2 are the param storage).
+# FLASH_RESERVE_START_KB 0 places the bootloader itself at 0x08000000 — the
+# generator's default of 16 links it at +16K, whose vector table then points
+# 16K past the flashed code: reset lands in erased flash, UNDEFINSTR HardFault
+# on the first instruction (found the hard way with openocd + the stacked
+# exception frame).
+FLASH_RESERVE_START_KB 0
 FLASH_BOOTLOADER_LOAD_KB 96
 
 PA11 OTG_FS_DM OTG1
